<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style/forgot_password.css">
  <title>비밀번호 찾기</title>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="top-wrapper">
      <!-- noteHub 로고 -->
      <div class="logo">
        <a href="/">
          <img src="/images/notehub-high-resolution-logo-transparent (1).png" alt="NoteHub로고"> 
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  <h2>비밀번호 찾기</h2>
  <p class="description">
    아이디와 학번을 입력하시면 임시 비밀번호를 발급해드립니다.
  </p>

  <% if (error) { %>
    <div class="error-box"><%= error %></div>
  <% } %>

  <% if (success) { %>
    <div class="success-box"><%- success %></div>
  <% } %>

  <form method="POST" action="/auth/forgot-password">
    <label for="userId">아이디</label>
    <input id="userId" type="text" name="id" required placeholder="아이디를 입력하세요" />

    <label for="userStudentId">학번</label>
    <input id="userStudentId" type="text" name="studentId" required placeholder="학번을 입력하세요" />

    <button type="submit">임시 비밀번호 발급</button>
  </form>

  <p class="link-row">
    <a href="/auth/login">로그인</a>
    <span class="divider">|</span>
    <a href="/auth/signup">회원가입</a>
  </p>
</body>
</html>